review:
Pros:
+ Nice graphics (in general + slow motion bullet cam);
+ No too-much-annoying bugs (at least for me);
+ Nice entertainment for 8-10 hours;

Cons:
- Often predictable AI;
- No reason, why one should do a 2nd play-through:
   You are told when to run (and where), wait (and how long), shoot (whom), ...
   (Thanks god, there are no toilets in game! Otherwise they would even tell you when to...)

Conclusion:
1.: A nice game. Not as cool as part one of the SGW series, but still nice.
2.: Do your self a favour and buy only at reduced price. Everything over 4€ or $ is not justified!
